### Add Samsung
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}{{manufacturer_mapping}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Samsung
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="logo_samsung.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./assets/logo/logo_samsung.png
--WebAppBoundary--

